oc-opus is part of OpenChroma and is licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0 or later (see the
workspace license). It is a Rust port of the decoder part of the libopus
reference implementation (version 1.5.2, https://opus-codec.org/, the
reference code of RFC 6716), float build, plus the multistream decoder of
RFC 7845. The ported code remains subject to the libopus BSD-3-Clause license
reproduced below; the copyright notices of the ported files are also kept in
the headers of the corresponding Rust source files.

Ported libopus files:
  celt/entdec.c, celt/entcode.c, celt/laplace.c       -> src/range_dec.rs
  celt/static_modes_float.h, celt/modes.c             -> src/celt/static_modes.rs, src/celt/mode.rs
  celt/kiss_fft.c, celt/mdct.c                        -> src/celt/mdct.rs
  celt/cwrs.c, celt/vq.c                              -> src/celt/vq.rs
  celt/bands.c                                        -> src/celt/bands.rs
  celt/quant_bands.c                                  -> src/celt/energy.rs, src/celt/mode.rs
  celt/rate.c, celt/rate.h                            -> src/celt/rate.rs
  celt/celt.c, celt/pitch.c, celt/celt_lpc.c          -> src/celt/pitch.rs, src/celt/mode.rs
  celt/mathops.c, celt/mathops.h, celt/x86/pitch_sse.c -> src/celt/math.rs
  celt/celt_decoder.c                                 -> src/celt/decoder.rs
  silk/dec_API.c, silk/stereo_*.c                     -> src/silk/mod.rs
  silk/decode_*.c, silk/decoder_set_fs.c, silk/init_decoder.c,
  silk/shell_coder.c, silk/code_signs.c, silk/gain_quant.c -> src/silk/decode.rs
  silk/NLSF*.c, silk/LPC_*.c, silk/bwexpander*.c, silk/sort.c -> src/silk/lpc.rs
  silk/PLC.c, silk/CNG.c                              -> src/silk/plc.rs
  silk/resampler*.c                                   -> src/silk/resampler.rs
  silk/tables_*.c, silk/table_LSF_cos.c, silk/pitch_est_tables.c,
  silk/resampler_rom.c                                -> src/silk/tables.rs
  silk/macros.h, silk/SigProc_FIX.h, silk/Inlines.h,
  silk/lin2log.c, silk/log2lin.c, silk/sum_sqr_shift.c -> src/silk/macros.rs
  src/opus.c, src/opus_decoder.c                      -> src/packet.rs, src/opus.rs
  src/opus_multistream_decoder.c                      -> src/multistream.rs

